# The tech arm, unlocking every land factory it ever builds. The lean
# sibling (techprobe, tech 1) buys one unlock -- the roster opens at the
# first -- and this arm asks whether heavy throughput from every factory
# is worth 2,000 credits of saving pause apiece ([[policy-budget]]).

name techprobe-all
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 9
